{
  "protocol": "DM20",
  "description": "The Ver.20th's attack tables. `single` is measured: fifteen battles were played against a real Ver.20th, one per point of the tap meter, and what the Digimon fired each round was read off the screen (utilities/DIGIROM/dm20pattern.txt). `tag` is the older tag-battle table and is untouched.\n\nA value is the attack, and the attack is its damage: 1 single weak, 2 single strong, 3 double weak, 4 double strong. Critical is a fifth attack that only Tag Battles reach, so it never appears here.\n\nThe table this replaced held only 1s and 2s -- it recorded how many shots went out and not which sprite, so a Strong and a Double Weak were the same entry in it.",
